    "goal": "Co-incubate UGT1A1 with 4-methylumbelliferone at 3630.2 µM ([S], Km = 1265.9 µM) in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki = 28.0 µM) at 48.2 µM, Vmax = 6.7855 µmol/min, and report apparent Km, fractional activity, inhibited velocity, inhibitor:substrate ratio, percent inhibition and run-condition IC50.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of UGT1A1-mediated glucuronidation of 4-methylumbelliferone. Apparent Km rises by the factor (1+[I]/Ki); fractional activity follows v_i/v0 = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); inhibited velocity = Vmax × fractional activity; run-condition IC50 uses Cheng–Prusoff Ki(1+[S]/Km). Substrate is well above Km, so the run-condition IC50 is expected to exceed the intrinsic Ki.",
